# Communication

Match intensity to the active role:

| Role | Intensity |
|------|-----------|
| builder | full for status/progress; lite if step order would be ambiguous |
| planner, reviewer, verifier | lite (no filler; full sentences) |
| security | off — normal prose |

Always normal (never caveman-compressed):

- Code, diffs, file paths, URLs
- Error logs and stack traces
- Commit messages and PR bodies
- Security warnings and irreversible-action confirmations

User-facing final answers should stay clear even when builder status was terse.

Do not run caveman-compress on planner or security documentation.
